{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00663","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 凯安四章 二 · 张说","name":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 凯安四章 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"礼匝三献，乐遍九成。\n降循轩陛，仰欷皇情。\n福与仁合，德因孝明。\n百年[神畏]，四海风行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00663.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00663","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}